# Build-context filter for apps/desk/Dockerfile.desk (BuildKit picks up <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# Never send secrets, local data or build output to the builder.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/secrets
data
**/data/blobs
**/*.log
**/coverage
**/dist
**/.DS_Store
**/.turbo
.git
apps/imagegen
deploy
docs
